    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Chapter 4 · Session 19</span>\n<h2>Session 19 — The transmission of American culture</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13843 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Chương 4 · Buổi 19</span>\n<h2>Buổi 19 — The transmission of American culture</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13843 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO3, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO3, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>The transmission of American culture<br>- The impact of specific areas of American popular culture like music, Hollywood, television, and sports on other societies<br>- McDonaldization: homogenization of business and of taste?<br>- Local Americanisation: accommodation and resistance<br>- The return of protectionism: tariffs and trade wars</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>* Textbook: Chapter 10<br>* Examples of popular American artists, films, television shows, sports (and sportspeople), food, and cultural traditions<br>* McDonaldization: How Fast Food Homogenizes Global Taste and Culture (<a href=\"https://spinetimes.pk/mcdonaldization-how-fast-food-homogenizes-global-taste-and-culture/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://spinetimes.pk/mcdonaldization-how-fast-food-homogenizes-global-taste-and-culture/</a>)<br>* The McDonaldization of society (<a href=\"https://youtu.be/gCj_VhLgcmY?si=wZHHa5WhOy3kutJ6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://youtu.be/gCj_VhLgcmY?si=wZHHa5WhOy3kutJ6</a>)<br>* Why Starbucks Struggles In Vietnam's $1B Coffee Market (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llwyY4BDbfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=llwyY4BDbfc</a>)<br>* Starbucks Vietnam: Why the US chain cannot crack a coffee-loving nation (<a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-66167222\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.bbc.com/news/world-asia-66167222</a>)<br>* The False Dilemma Between Protectionism and Free Trade (<a href=\"https://www.tni.org/en/article/the-false-dilemma-between-protectionism-and-free-trade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.tni.org/en/article/the-false-dilemma-between-protectionism-and-free-trade</a>)<br>* The populist logic behind Trump’s tariffs (<a href=\"https://blogs.lse.ac.uk/politicsandpolicy/the-populist-logic-behind-trumps-tariffs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://blogs.lse.ac.uk/politicsandpolicy/the-populist-logic-behind-trumps-tariffs/</a>)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Lecture; Discussion; Presentations; Quizzes - at lecturer's discretion</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ7.1</strong> — With your background knowledge, how would you define gender and sexuality in the US? Is it similar to your country Vietnam? To what extent are they similar or different?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
