    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Chapter 11 · Session 52</span>\n<h2>Session 52 — Gender politics: Feminist movements in the USA and Great Britain</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13843 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Chương 11 · Buổi 52</span>\n<h2>Buổi 52 — Gender politics: Feminist movements in the USA and Great Britain</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13843 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">LO1, LO2, LO3, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Gender politics: Feminist movements in the USA and Great Britain<br>- The 'first wave: Women's suffrage<br>- The 'second wave': The Second Sex and The Feminine Mystique<br>- The 'third wave' and beyond: Intersectionality, Me Too, and trans-inclusivity<br>- The backlash: male violence against women and reproductive rights under threat</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>* American Culture Textbook: Chapter 7<br>* Votes for women in Britain (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=16J96t7k5MQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=16J96t7k5MQ</a>)<br>* The 19th Amendment (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a9LmBgY-F5A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a9LmBgY-F5A</a>)<br>* How women won the right to vote around the world (<a href=\"https://www.britannica.com/video/history-woman-suffrage-world/-187145\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.britannica.com/video/history-woman-suffrage-world/-187145</a>)<br>* Feminism: The Second Wave (<a href=\"https://www.womenshistory.org/exhibits/feminism-second-wave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.womenshistory.org/exhibits/feminism-second-wave</a>)<br>* The Revolutionary Practice of Black Feminisms (<a href=\"https://nmaahc.si.edu/explore/stories/revolutionary-practice-black-feminisms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://nmaahc.si.edu/explore/stories/revolutionary-practice-black-feminisms</a>)<br>* Audre Lorde: The Master's Tools Will Never Dismantle the Master's House (<a href=\"https://awpc.cattcenter.iastate.edu/2025/08/28/the-masters-tools-will-never-dismantle-the-masters-house-oct-29-1979/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://awpc.cattcenter.iastate.edu/2025/08/28/the-masters-tools-will-never-dismantle-the-masters-house-oct-29-1979/</a>)<br>* The urgency of intersectionality (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=akOe5-UsQ2o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=akOe5-UsQ2o</a>)<br>* Supreme Court overturns Roe v. Wade, ending right to abortion upheld for decades (<a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2022/06/24/1102305878/supreme-court-abortion-roe-v-wade-decision-overturn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.npr.org/2022/06/24/1102305878/supreme-court-abortion-roe-v-wade-decision-overturn</a>)<br>* Margaret Atwood: The Court Is Making Gilead Real (<a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/archive/2022/05/supreme-court-roe-handmaids-tale-abortion-margaret-atwood/629833/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/archive/2022/05/supreme-court-roe-handmaids-tale-abortion-margaret-atwood/629833/</a>)<br>* UN Women - One in four countries report backlash on women’s rights in 2024 (<a href=\"https://www.unwomen.org/en/news-stories/press-release/2025/03/one-in-four-countries-report-backlash-on-womens-rights-in-2024\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.unwomen.org/en/news-stories/press-release/2025/03/one-in-four-countries-report-backlash-on-womens-rights-in-2024</a>)<br>* UN Women - Facts and figures: Ending violence against women (<a href=\"https://www.unwomen.org/en/articles/facts-and-figures/facts-and-figures-ending-violence-against-women\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.unwomen.org/en/articles/facts-and-figures/facts-and-figures-ending-violence-against-women</a>) - Resource regularly updated, to check for the latest figures</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Lecture; Discussion; Presentations; Quizzes - at lecturer's discretion</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions — answer them yourself first</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo — tự trả lời trước</h3></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CQ18.1</strong> — What are teds/mods/skinheads/hippies/punks/raves/subcultures? What are their respective tastes in music and/or fashion?</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
